## `Raffle._update` in `target/packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol` (L497-L502)

**Analysis-stage selection:** local model selection `gpt-daybreak-blue-latest`, reasoning effort `ultra`, access program `daybreak_blue`, fallback disabled. No provider-returned model field was exposed, so the provider-returned model is `unknown`.

**Purpose:** This override is the common pre-hook for ticket ownership changes. It rejects a nonzero recipient classified as same-factory protocol plumbing, then delegates authorization, approval clearing, balance changes, owner storage, and the ERC-721 `Transfer` event to the inherited ledger (`target/packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:L491-L502`; `target/packages/contracts/node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts/token/ERC721/ERC721.sol:L216-L244`). Burns pass `address(0)`, skip destination classification, and still delegate the ownership deletion to the inherited implementation (`target/packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:L492-L501`). The hook does not read raffle lifecycle status, so the inherited public transfer surface applies the same destination rule in every lifecycle state (`target/packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:L491-L502`; `target/packages/contracts/node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts/token/ERC721/ERC721.sol:L114-L136`).

---

**Inputs & Assumptions:**

- `to` (`address`): the prospective owner. Trust is **untrusted** on `buyEntries(recipient, ...)` and inherited public transfer paths, because an external caller supplies it (`target/packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:L209-L218`, `L235`; `target/packages/contracts/node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts/token/ERC721/ERC721.sol:L114-L135`). It is the internally supplied zero address on both Raffle burn paths (`target/packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:L325`, `L364`; `target/packages/contracts/node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts/token/ERC721/ERC721.sol:L303-L307`). The public and internal mint/transfer helpers reject zero before dispatch, while `_burn` deliberately supplies zero (`target/packages/contracts/node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts/token/ERC721/ERC721.sol:L115-L121`, `L259-L263`, `L303-L304`, `L321-L325`).
